            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"types-carriers\">Types &amp; Carriers</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook walks through Protomorph's type algebra hands-on.\nWe cover <code>Spec</code>, <code>VaryingType</code>, <code>UniformType</code>, <code>UnionType</code>, <code>IndexedType</code>,\n<code>Qual</code>, and how to wrap values into carriers.</span></span>"
